Manage apps

Usage: vendo apps [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list      List all apps
  diagnose  Show apps that need attention
  get       Get app details
  pause     Pause an app
  resume    Resume a paused app
  delete    Delete an app (soft delete)
  create    Create a new app
  update    Update an app
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
  -h, --help            Print help
